    "text": "Two wires <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> &amp; <math><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> are carrying currents <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> as shown in the figure. The separation between them is <math><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></math> . A third wire <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> carrying a current <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> is to be kept parallel to them at a distance <math><mi>x</mi></math> from <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> such that the net force acting on it is zero. The possible values of <math><mi>x</mi></math> are:<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/9e330215-802c-4513-8393-937be25aee23-image.png\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 176px;\" />",
    "image": null
